WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.080
If you take injectable GLP-1 medications or other weight-loss drugs such as

2
00:00:04.080 --> 00:00:07.360
phentermine, there's an important step to be aware of before your procedure.

3
00:00:07.360 --> 00:00:11.110
These medications slow digestion, which can affect how your stomach empties and

4
00:00:11.110 --> 00:00:11.680
may interfere

5
00:00:11.680 --> 00:00:15.360
with your prep. For that reason, your care team may ask you to hold your GLP-1

6
00:00:15.360 --> 00:00:16.560
before your colonoscopy.

7
00:00:16.560 --> 00:00:20.720
Typically, you will need to hold your dose for 1 week. But if you are not

8
00:00:20.720 --> 00:00:21.120
sure,

9
00:00:21.120 --> 00:00:24.740
please call your doctor's office to confirm exactly when to take your last dose

10
00:00:24.740 --> 00:00:24.960
.

11
00:00:24.960 --> 00:00:28.960
Do not stop or adjust any medication without speaking with them first.

12
00:00:29.520 --> 00:00:32.720
We just want to make sure everything goes smoothly on procedure day.
